==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[St. Pigge the 2nd]] spawns.
**1 [[St. Pigge the 2nd]] spawns.
**1 [[St. Pigge the 2nd]] spawns.

==Strategy==
A standard slew of [[:Category:Anti-Red Cats|anti-Red]] and [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] will work fine here. [[Axe Cat (Normal Cat)|Brave Cat]] and [[Fish Cat (Normal Cat)|Whale Cat]] can do good damage to the St. Pigges. If available, [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Paris Cat]] and [[Swordsman Cat (Rare Cat)|Swordsman Cat]] can do great damage to the St. Pigges. With these anti-Reds it should be a walk in the park.

